# Manifold level 10
# The gate (stage 5n, decision 0031): the wall's last section, at six, the sky going pale. A first hall:
# two sentries, and at its far end a brute (it hardly stops: what the launcher is for, in the west room).
# The red key in the east room. North of the hall, a yard; the red door: the court before the gate, where
# the last of them come in two groups. Close the gate. In the west room's corner, a button: a closet of
# rockets and armor. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-4.plan).
title The gate
spawn 0 1 1
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.42
sky 6.0

